</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{V}\leftarrow\mathcal{V}(V)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">Z</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒱</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{V}\leftarrow\mathcal{V}(V)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><span id="alg1.l5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Encode video frames into patch tokens
</span>
</div>
