</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="S3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Computer-use trajectory videos contain a large number of fine-grained elements at different scales, such as windows, icons, menus, cursors, and small text. Training reward models for computer use often benefits from high-resolution video inputs, where these subtle UI cues are clearly visible. However, the computational cost of processing high-resolution frames is substantial: naively placing all frames at full resolution into the model context quickly exhausts the token budget and leads to prohibitive memory usage, making it difficult to fit long interaction trajectories into a single forward-backward pass. To address this issue, we propose <em id="S3.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Spatiotemporal Token Pruning</em>, which can significantly reduce the effective context length by pruning redundant visual tokens in both space and time. As summarized in <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ 3.3 Spatiotemporal Token Pruning ‣ 3 Execution Video Reward Modeling ‣ Video-Based Reward Modeling for Computer-Use Agents" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm 1</span></a>, we combine Spatial Token Pruning (STP; <a href="#S3.SS3.SSSx1" title="Spatial Token Pruning ‣ 3.3 Spatiotemporal Token Pruning ‣ 3 Execution Video Reward Modeling ‣ Video-Based Reward Modeling for Computer-Use Agents" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section 3.3</span></a>) to discard spatially redundant background regions within each frame, and Temporal Token Pruning (TTP; <a href="#S3.SS3.SSSx2" title="Temporal Token Pruning ‣ 3.3 Spatiotemporal Token Pruning ‣ 3 Execution Video Reward Modeling ‣ Video-Based Reward Modeling for Computer-Use Agents" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section 3.3</span></a>) to suppress temporally repeated tokens across frames, enabling efficient training with high-resolution videos without sacrificing the transient UI evidence critical for decision making.</p>
</div>
<section id="S3.SS3.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Spatial Token Pruning</h4>

<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Spatial Token Pruning (STP)</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Patch features </span><math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐏</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{P}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, adjacency threshold </span><math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">τ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{s}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, large-component threshold </span><math id="alg2.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\text{large}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">τ</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">large</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\text{large}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Reshape </span><math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{P}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐏</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{P}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times D}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> into per-frame grids </span><math id="alg2.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{P}^{(t)}\in\mathbb{R}^{H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}\times D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐏</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">H</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">W</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{P}^{(t)}\in\mathbb{R}^{H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}\times D}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><math id="alg2.l2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in[T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in[T]</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span><span id="alg2.l3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leftarrow 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leftarrow 1</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg2.l3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">to</span><span id="alg2.l3.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="alg2.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l3.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">. </span><span id="alg2.l3.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">do</span><span id="alg2.l3.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Compute neighbor distances </span><math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{h}^{(t)}(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{h}^{(t)}(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and </span><math id="alg2.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{v}^{(t)}(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">v</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{v}^{(t)}(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> from </span><math id="alg2.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{P}^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐏</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{P}^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l4.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Define adjacency indicator </span><math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e^{(t)}_{(i,j)\leftrightarrow(i^{\prime},j^{\prime})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">↔</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e^{(t)}_{(i,j)\leftrightarrow(i^{\prime},j^{\prime})}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> using </span><math id="alg2.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">τ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{s}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Build graph </span><math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}^{(t)}=(V^{(t)},E^{(t)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">E</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}^{(t)}=(V^{(t)},E^{(t)})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> from </span><math id="alg2.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e_{(i,j)\leftrightarrow(i^{\prime},j^{\prime})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">↔</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e_{(i,j)\leftrightarrow(i^{\prime},j^{\prime})}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Obtain connected components </span><math id="alg2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}^{(t)}=\{C_{k}^{(t)}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒞</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">C</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}^{(t)}=\{C_{k}^{(t)}\}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Mark large components </span><math id="alg2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}^{(t)}\subseteq\mathcal{C}^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℛ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊆</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒞</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}^{(t)}\subseteq\mathcal{C}^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> using </span><math id="alg2.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\text{large}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">τ</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">large</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\text{large}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l9.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Construct spatial mask </span><math id="alg2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}_{s}^{(t)}\in\{0,1\}^{H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐌</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">H</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">W</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}_{s}^{(t)}\in\{0,1\}^{H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> from </span><math id="alg2.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℛ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l9.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">end</span><span id="alg2.l10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg2.l10.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">return</span><span id="alg2.l11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="alg2.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\mathbf{M}_{s}^{(t)}\}_{t=1}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐌</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathbf{M}_{s}^{(t)}\}_{t=1}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{P}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐏</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{P}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times D}</annotation></semantics></math> denote the patch-feature matrix produced by the frozen vision encoder, where <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=T\times H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=T\times H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> is the total number of spatiotemporal patches across <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> frames on an <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> grid, and <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> is the feature dimension. Inspired by ShowUI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib3" title="" class="ltx_ref">37</a>]</cite>, we construct a per-frame UI-connected graph <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}^{(t)}=(V^{(t)},E^{(t)})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}^{(t)}=(V^{(t)},E^{(t)})</annotation></semantics></math>, where each node in <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math> corresponds to a patch and edges in <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math> connect spatial neighbors with similar features. The resulting connected components are denoted by <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}^{(t)}=\{C_{1}^{(t)},\ldots,C_{K_{t}}^{(t)}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}^{(t)}=\{C_{1}^{(t)},\ldots,C_{K_{t}}^{(t)}\}</annotation></semantics></math>. We use <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> as the similarity threshold for establishing edges, and <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\text{large}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>large</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\text{large}}</annotation></semantics></math> as the size threshold for identifying components to be removed. For each frame <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, STP outputs a binary mask <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}^{(t)}_{s}\in\{0,1\}^{H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐌</mi><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}^{(t)}_{s}\in\{0,1\}^{H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math> indicating which patches are retained.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For a single frame <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, we reshape patch features into a grid <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{P}^{(t)}\in\mathbb{R}^{H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}\times D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{P}^{(t)}\in\mathbb{R}^{H^{\prime}\times W^{\prime}\times D}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H^{\prime}=H/m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H^{\prime}=H/m</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W^{\prime}=W/m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W^{\prime}=W/m</annotation></semantics></math> for merge size <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>. We first compute local feature differences between neighboring patches. The horizontal difference is</p>
<table id="S3.E1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d^{(t)}_{h}(i,j)=\left\|\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i,j}-\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i,j+1}\right\|_{2},\quad 1\leq i\leq H^{\prime},\;1\leq j&lt;W^{\prime}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn> 1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d^{(t)}_{h}(i,j)=\left\|\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i,j}-\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i,j+1}\right\|_{2},\quad 1\leq i\leq H^{\prime},\;1\leq j&lt;W^{\prime},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(1)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">while the vertical difference is</p>
<table id="S3.E2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d^{(t)}_{v}(i,j)=\left\|\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i,j}-\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i+1,j}\right\|_{2},\quad 1\leq i&lt;H^{\prime},\;1\leq j\leq W^{\prime}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn> 1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>W</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d^{(t)}_{v}(i,j)=\left\|\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i,j}-\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i+1,j}\right\|_{2},\quad 1\leq i&lt;H^{\prime},\;1\leq j\leq W^{\prime}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.3" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math> be the 4-neighborhood of location <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math>. Two patches are connected if they are neighbors and their feature distance is below <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{s}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="S3.E3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E3.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="e^{(t)}_{(i,j)\leftrightarrow(i^{\prime},j^{\prime})}=\mathds{1}\!\left[(i^{\prime},j^{\prime})\in\mathcal{N}(i,j)\;\land\;\left\|\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i,j}-\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i^{\prime},j^{\prime}}\right\|_{2}&lt;\tau_{s}\right]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>j</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo rspace="0.108em">=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>j</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.502em">∧</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><msup><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>j</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e^{(t)}_{(i,j)\leftrightarrow(i^{\prime},j^{\prime})}=\mathds{1}\!\left[(i^{\prime},j^{\prime})\in\mathcal{N}(i,j)\;\land\;\left\|\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i,j}-\mathbf{P}^{(t)}_{i^{\prime},j^{\prime}}\right\|_{2}&lt;\tau_{s}\right].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(3)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We then apply Union-Find on <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}^{(t)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math> to obtain connected components and select large components for pruning:</p>
<table id="S3.E4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}^{(t)}=\text{Union-Find}\!\left(V^{(t)},E^{(t)}\right),\quad\mathcal{R}^{(t)}=\left\{C\in\mathcal{C}^{(t)}:|C|&gt;\tau_{\text{large}}\right\}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mpadded style="width:5.232em;" width="5.232em"><mtext>Union-Find</mtext></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>large</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}^{(t)}=\text{Union-Find}\!\left(V^{(t)},E^{(t)}\right),\quad\mathcal{R}^{(t)}=\left\{C\in\mathcal{C}^{(t)}:|C|&gt;\tau_{\text{large}}\right\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(4)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{(t)}(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{(t)}(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math> denote the component containing patch <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math>. The spatial mask is</p>
<table id="S3.E5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}^{(t)}_{s}(i,j)=\begin{cases}0&amp;\text{if }C^{(t)}(i,j)\in\mathcal{R}^{(t)},\\
1&amp;\text{otherwise}.\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐌</mi><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>otherwise</mtext><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}^{(t)}_{s}(i,j)=\begin{cases}0&amp;\text{if }C^{(t)}(i,j)\in\mathcal{R}^{(t)},\\
1&amp;\text{otherwise}.\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(5)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p4.2" class="ltx_p">Applying <math id="S3.SS3.SSSx1.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}^{(t)}_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐌</mi><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}^{(t)}_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> filters the original token grid and packs the remaining tokens into a shorter sequence, which is then fed to the vision-language model. This parameter-free procedure preserves local UI structure and effectively reduces redundant spatial tokens while retaining fine-grained cues.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg3" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span> Temporal Token Pruning (TTP)</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg3.l1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Video tokens </span><math id="alg3.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}\in\mathbb{R}^{T\times N\times D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐕</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}\in\mathbb{R}^{T\times N\times D}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg3.l1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, threshold </span><math id="alg3.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">τ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg3.l1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, similarity </span><math id="alg3.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{sim}_{\text{cos}}(\cdot,\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext mathsize="0.900em">sim</mtext><mtext mathsize="0.900em">cos</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{sim}_{\text{cos}}(\cdot,\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg3.l1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg3.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span><span id="alg3.l2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="alg3.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg3.l2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg3.l2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">to</span><span id="alg3.l2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="alg3.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg3.l2.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg3.l2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">do</span><span id="alg3.l2.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg3.l3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="alg3.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{v}^{(\text{ref})}_{i}\leftarrow\mathbf{v}^{(0)}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mtext mathsize="0.900em">ref</mtext><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}^{(\text{ref})}_{i}\leftarrow\mathbf{v}^{(0)}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg3.l3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg3.l3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg3.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Frame <math id="alg3.l3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math> is the initial reference frame
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                
                
