<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Pt0.A4.F11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 11</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A4.F11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Prompt of ZeroGUI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib63" title="" class="ltx_ref">73</a>]</cite></span></figcaption>
